                            	  2249:     ; If zora died in the call above, then it happened while in
                            	  2250:     ; states 2, 3, or 4. In the code below, the state won't be 0.
                            	  2251:     ; So, it won't flag the zora inactive. This is why the zora does
                            	  2252:     ; not come back after killing it.
