02:0003FFF4 00040042        	   196:     dc.l    UpdateMenuCommon1   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003FFF8 00040078        	   197:     dc.l    UpdateMenuCommon2   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
